    },
    {
      "step": "Step 4: Assess immediacy of threat and legitimacy of preemptive killing",
      "finding": "F5 establishes that Daenerys was unarmed and not attacking Jon at the moment, so there was no immediate threat warranting lethal force; no council, detention, or surrender was sought, undermining the justification."
    },
    {
      "step": "Step 5: Draw conclusion",
      "finding": "Not_justified because the record lacks imminent danger and formal authority, despite broader warnings of future harm implied by F1–F3."
